:: Watcher Observation Deck {"position":"1700,1400","size":"100,100"}

The figure doesn't turn as you approach. It doesn't need to.



The organism has moved closer. Its signal is consistent with what we recorded on arrival. The pattern is still shifting.


[[Return to observation deck|Observation Deck]]



